WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.600
Vegans Explore is a home base for the Vegan community.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.900
Find Vegan restaurants, brands and businesses,

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.900
plus the nonprofits, rescues and sanctuaries worth supporting,

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.400
all ranked by member votes.

5
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:18.300
See what's happening in your city, explore our Guides,

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.000
and join the Daily Pulse conversation.

7
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.000
We officially launch on January 1, 2027.

8
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.500
Right now, we're building it city by city,

9
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.800
from South Florida to London, with the people who live there.

10
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.200
That makes this the best time to shape it.

11
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.600
Use it over the coming weeks and months.

12
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.400
Tell us what's missing, what works, and how we can support you.

13
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:42.900
We have the tools and resources to create the platform this community deserves.

14
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.200
We just need you.

15
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.600
Founding Membership is $11, one time, with 1,100 welcome points.

16
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:56.000
Founding Membership closes at midnight Eastern on January 1, 2027.

17
00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.200
Join before then, and Founding Member stays on your profile for good.

18
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.500
Become a Founding Member today at vegansexplore.com.
